ReShiki workspace modules included in the build
------------------------------------------------
The following ReShiki crates, vendored under vendor/ReShiki/, are compiled
into the WASM binary:

  reshikist           Typst WASM plugin entry-point
  reshiki-io          Exchange formats, chemistry engine, export and SVG
                      output (includes crate-local build.rs embedded data
                      from data/nmr/index.tsv.deflate)
  reshiki-model       Documents, scenes, styles, editing and template
                      system (includes crate-local build.rs embedded data
                      from assets/templates.json.deflate)
  reshiki-chemistry   Molecular preparation, depiction, identifiers
                      (includes crate-local build.rs embedded data from
                      src/depict/templates/builtin.json.deflate,
                      and files from src/depict/templates/)
  reshiki-metafile    Bounded EMF framing and physical picture dimensions
  reshiki-depict-math Paired math call for the pinned native depiction ABI
  reshiki-process-heap Bounded allocator for isolated worker processes

  reshiki-geometry    (under native/geometry/) Rust MMFF/UFF and ETKDG
                      geometry solver; the wrapper, adapter and worker
                      integration are original ReShiki code.

ReShiki code is copyright (c) 2026 Ameyanagi and ReShiki contributors,
licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. Its own third-party attributions follow below.

