    https://github.com/Ameyanagi/nazuchem
    rev 5dd39d8245b43d3437c9bb2ab881eeafca8221d7
    Licenced MIT.

  The nazuchem naming engines are compiled into the WASM binary:
    name-to-structure  Rust port of OPSIN by Daniel Lowe (MIT),
                       tracking main after 2.9.0.
    structure-to-name  Port of openclatura 0.4.3 by lamalab-org (MIT),
                       extended in nazuchem.
    Includes OPSIN-derived data and a CPython integer-set adaptation
    (Python-2.0). The retained heterocycle list is transcribed from
    IUPAC Recommendations 2013, P-25.2.1 Table 2.8 (IUPAC copyright;
    no licence asserted).

Complete nazuchem per-file provenance and licenses are retained in the
nazuchem repository at the git pin above.

